            "notes": "We start Round 1 by taking [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422), this power is fundamental to our build later on as I will explain when it becomes relevant, for now focus on spamming your whipshot to maintain your repair packs and generate as much income as possible!\n\nNote: This build excels playing into and with brawlier compositions, playing this into a team running full poke is hellish and I do NOT recommend it.\n\nAs an alternative to [Packstacker](item_87b99cde-3089-42fd-86bc-6e1ebf3fe422), if you suck at hitting your whipshots you can optionally take [Mender Bender](item_df95cea8-7040-4bfc-9145-8b820edce5a3) as this will allow you to constantly proc inspire, however do note that by taking this power you are weakening the build significantly! \n\nFrom Round 1 to 3 we will be focusing on stacking as much [Ability Power](stat_ability_power) as possible, this is important as not only does it make our repair packs more potent, but affords us a good source of damage via our whipshot and makes our inspire all the more powerful, this build will become a frontlining demon once we get to Round 3.",
