            "notes": "Round 3 is the round that we fully pivot to the build, there are a lot of important notes to take for this round.\n\nFirstly we are going to take [Optimizer](item_13d41c37-8f79-4435-9d81-c9599955f6a8), this power is going to make you NIGH unkillable as long as you are constantly packing someone. I recommend mindlessly putting it on your tank or whoever is closest to you and remember to do so every few seconds, in addition to this make sure you are using your whipshot and shield bash as often as you can as this will extend your packs duration and allow you to heal yourself even more!\n\nSecondly we take our enable items, the more important of the two is [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) as this effectively lets us double stack our self heal with every melee we do, the next item we will take is [Nullifier Neuroworks](item_6501be99-b951-4dad-9bb5-8305eb17d84e) which further enables our repair packs with a ridiculous amount of cooldown reduction. The synergy is self evident and you will genuinely become such a super tank.\n\n[Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) is the more important of the two so make sure you have that if you are lacking in money, and build as much attack speed as you can with whatever is left over.",
