            "notes": "Starting at Round 5 we take [Consecrated Ground](item_fbdd3ee7-e527-4549-8dda-796c428270ee) so we can get rally as soon as possible, since rally really just makes us tankier and allows us to hold w into their whole team even harder it is the best thing we can take power-wise.\n\nDepending on how the game has been going so far, either take [Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) to allow for more sustain, or take [Dragon's Incinerator](item_d0794681-844b-4ce8-9857-15320f35a634) to make your rally even more volatile and make you genuinely immortal. We will be taking both of these after this round but for now pick whichever supports you best in the round.\n\nWith any spare money continue to stack [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed).",
