            "notes": "By Round 6 you (hopefully) should be able to afford all of the suggested items, if not don't worry too much as [Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7) and [Nullifier Neuroworks](item_6501be99-b951-4dad-9bb5-8305eb17d84e) should be doing more than enough to keep you powerful.\n\nIf you are doing REALLY well you can pick up [Three-tap Tommygun](item_39c5d2a4-1db0-444f-86d9-2a1e9a331429) or [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) depending on if you want to deal more damage/heal or prevent burst damage, but other than that same as before just continue to get the suggested items and/or [Attack Speed](stat_attack_speed).",
